@TodoApiV2_HostAddress = http://localhost:5018

### Get All Categories
GET {{TodoApiV2_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Create Category
POST {{TodoApiV2_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Groceries"
}

### Get Category by ID
GET {{TodoApiV2_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### Update Category
PUT {{TodoApiV2_HostAddress}}/api/categories/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "Food"
}

### Delete Category
DELETE {{TodoApiV2_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1